  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sauli Ajaribu Kumuua Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli akamwambia mwanawe Yonathani na watumishi wake wote wamuue Daudi. Lakini Yonathani mwana wa Sauli alimpenda sana Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonathani akamwonya Daudi, akisema, \"Baba yangu Sauli anatafuta nafasi ya kukuua. Ujilinde kesho asubuhi, nenda mahali pa siri na ukae huko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitatoka na kukaa na baba yangu shambani mahali uliko. Nitazungumza naye juu yako, nami nitakueleza nitakachogundua.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonathani akanena mema juu ya Daudi kwa Sauli baba yake na kumwambia, \"Mfalme asitende mabaya kwa mtumishi wake Daudi; hajakukosea, aliyoyafanya yamekuwa ya faida sana kwako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alihatarisha maisha yake alipomuua yule Mfilisti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.19.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.19.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akajipatia ushindi mkubwa kwa ajili ya Israeli wote, nawe uliuona na ukafurahi. Kwa nini basi utende mabaya kwa mtu asiye na hatia kama Daudi kwa kumuua bila sababu?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli akamsikiliza Yonathani na kuapa hivi: \"Hakika kama",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.19.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.19.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aishivyo, Daudi hatauawa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Yonathani akamwita Daudi na kumweleza mazungumzo yote. Akamleta kwa Sauli, naye Daudi akawa pamoja na Sauli kama kwanza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vita vilitokea tena, naye Daudi akatoka na kupigana na Wafilisti. Akawapiga kwa nguvu nyingi hata wakakimbia mbele yake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini roho mbaya iliyoachiwa nafasi na",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.19.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.19.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ikaja juu ya Sauli alipokuwa ameketi katika nyumba yake akiwa na mkuki mkononi mwake. Daudi alipokuwa anampigia kinubi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli akajaribu kumchomea Daudi ukutani kwa huo mkuki wake, lakini Daudi akauhepa huo mkuki wa Sauli ukakita ukutani. Usiku ule ule Daudi akakimbia na kuokoka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli akatuma watu nyumbani mwa Daudi wailinde hiyo nyumba na kumuua asubuhi. Lakini Mikali, mkewe Daudi, akamwonya akisema, \"Kama hukukimbia kuokoa maisha yako usiku huu, kesho yake utauawa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Mikali akamteremsha Daudi kupitia dirishani, naye akakimbia na kuokoka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Mikali akachukua kinyago, akakilaza kitandani, akakifunika kwa vazi na kukiwekea singa za mbuzi kichwani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli alipotuma watu kumkamata Daudi, Mikali akasema, \"Yeye ni mgonjwa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Sauli akatuma watu tena kumwona Daudi naye akawaambia, \"Mleteni kwangu juu ya kitanda chake ili nipate kumuua.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini wale watu walipoingia, kumbe ni kinyago tu kilichokuwa kitandani na kwenye kichwa kulikuwepo na singa za mbuzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli akamwambia Mikali, \"Kwa nini umenidanganya mimi hivi na kumwacha adui yangu aende zake ili apate kuokoka?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 19:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mikali akamwambia, \"Yeye aliniambia, 'Niache niende zangu. Kwa nini nikuue?' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi alipokuwa amekimbia na kuokoka, alimwendea Samweli huko Rama na kumwambia yale yote Sauli alimfanyia. Ndipo Daudi na Samweli wakaenda Nayothi kukaa huko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habari zikamfikia Sauli kusema: \"Daudi yuko Nayothi huko Rama.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Sauli akatuma watu kumkamata Daudi, lakini walipoona kundi la manabii wakitoa unabii, wakiwa pamoja na Samweli akiwa amesimama hapo kama kiongozi wao, Roho wa Mungu akaja juu ya watu wa Sauli, nao pia wakatoa unabii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli akaelezwa juu ya hilo, naye akapeleka watu wengine zaidi, nao wakatoa unabii pia. Sauli akatuma watu mara ya tatu, nao pia wakatoa unabii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwishowe, yeye mwenyewe akaondoka kwenda Rama na kwenda hadi kwenye kile kisima kikubwa kilichoko huko Seku. Naye akauliza, \"Wako wapi Samweli na Daudi?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 19:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wakasema, \"Wako Nayothi huko Rama.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo Sauli akaenda Nayothi huko Rama. Lakini Roho wa Mungu akaja juu yake hata yeye, akawa anatembea huku anatoa unabii hadi akafika Nayothi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akavua majoho yake na pia akatoa unabii mbele ya Samweli. Akalala hali hiyo ule mchana kutwa na usiku kucha. Hii ndiyo sababu watu husema, \"Je, Sauli pia yumo miongoni mwa manabii?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "1SA.20",
    "number": "20",
